<body>
<milestone n="1" unit="juan"/>
<pb n="0587c" ed="T" xml:id="T18.0892.0587c"/>
<lb n="0587c04" ed="T"/><cb:docNumber>No. 892</cb:docNumber>
<lb n="0587c05" ed="T"/><cb:juan n="001" fun="open"><cb:mulu n="001" type="卷"></cb:mulu><cb:jhead><anchor xml:id="nkr_note_orig_0587005" n="0587005"/>佛說大悲空智金剛大教王儀軌
<lb n="0587c06" ed="T"/>經卷第一<note place="inline">大幻化普通儀軌三十一分中略出二無我法</note></cb:jhead></cb:juan>
<lb n="0587c08" ed="T"/><byline cb:type="Translator">宋西天三藏
<lb n="0587c09" ed="T"/>法護奉　詔譯</byline>
<lb n="0587c10" ed="T"/><cb:div type="pin"><cb:mulu n="1" level="1" type="品">1 金剛部序品</cb:mulu><head>金剛部序品第一</head>
<lb n="0587c11" ed="T"/><p xml:id="p1">如是我聞：</p><p xml:id="p2" cb:place="inline">一時薄伽梵住<anchor xml:id="nkr_note_orig_0587006" n="0587006"/><anchor xml:id="beg0587006" n="0587006"/>一切如來身語
<lb n="0587c12" ed="T"/>心金剛喻施婆倪數<anchor xml:id="end0587006"/>祕密中祕密出生妙三摩
<lb n="0587c13" ed="T"/>地。時彼世尊從是三摩地起，讚言：「善哉，善哉。」</p>
<lb n="0587c14" ed="T"/><p xml:id="p3">次以龍華樹汁塗之<note place="inline">或以白蒿汁代之</note>，復以<anchor xml:id="beg0588b0801" n="0588b0801"/>晝<anchor xml:id="end0588b0801"/>夜作<g ref="#CB00768">𡁠</g>法。</p>
<lb n="0587c15" ed="T"/><lg type="regular" xml:id="lg1"><l>「最初觀於慈，<caesura/>次即觀於悲，</l>
<lb n="0587c16" ed="T"/><l><anchor xml:id="nkr_note_orig_0587007" n="0587007"/>第三當觀喜，<caesura/>一切處學捨。」</l></lg>
</cb:div>
<lb n="0587c17" ed="T"/><cb:div type="pin"><cb:mulu n="2" level="1" type="品">2 真言品</cb:mulu><head><anchor xml:id="nkr_note_orig_0587008" n="0587008"/>真言品第二</head>
<lb n="0587c18" ed="T"/><p cb:type="dharani" xml:id="p4">「<anchor xml:id="nkr_note_foreign_0587009" n="0587009"/><anchor xml:id="nkr_note_orig_0587009" n="0587009"/>唵<note place="inline">引</note><note place="inline">一</note>　阿吽<note place="inline">二
<lb n="0587c19" ed="T"/>合</note><note place="inline">二</note>　發吒<note place="inline">上呂角切下同</note>莎賀」</p>
<lb n="0587c20" ed="T"/><p xml:id="p5">十二處，一者某國、<note place="inline">七者、八者，梵本元闕</note>九者某城。</p>
<lb n="0587c21" ed="T"/><cb:juan n="001" fun="close"><cb:jhead>佛說大悲空智金剛大教王儀軌經卷第一</cb:jhead></cb:juan>
<lb n="0587c22" ed="T"/><cb:juan n="002" fun="open"><cb:jhead>佛說大悲空智金剛大教王儀軌經卷第二<note place="inline">第三同卷</note></cb:jhead>
<lb n="0587c23" ed="T"/><cb:jhead type="pin">真言品第二之餘</cb:jhead></cb:juan>
<lb n="0587c24" ed="T"/><p xml:id="p6">唵吽發吒。</p>
</cb:div>
</body>
<back>
