</p></cb:div>
<cb:div type="tt"><head>多語詞條對照</head><p>
<cb:tt type="app" from="#beg0587006" to="#end0587006">
	<cb:t resp="#resp2" xml:lang="zh-Hant">一切如來身語<lb n="0587c12" ed="T"/>心金剛喻施婆倪數</cb:t>
	<cb:t resp="#resp2" xml:lang="sa" place="foot">Sarvatathā-gata-kāya-vāk-citta-vajra-yogirbhageṣu.</cb:t>
</cb:tt>
</p></cb:div>
<cb:div type="cbeta-notes"><head>CBETA 校注</head><p>
<note n="0587008" resp="#resp1" type="mod" target="#nkr_note_mod_0587008">真言品第二 mantra-paṭala (a CBETA modification, not a Taisho footnote)</note>
</p></cb:div>
<cb:div type="taisho-notes"><head>大正藏 校注</head><p>
<note n="0587005" resp="#resp2" type="orig" place="foot text" target="#nkr_note_orig_0587005">【原】明本，東京帝國大學梵本三百三十五號, Hevajra-tantra</note>
<note n="0587006" resp="#resp2" type="orig" place="foot text" target="#nkr_note_orig_0587006">一切如…數 Sarvatathā-gata-kāya-vāk-citta-vajra-yogirbhageṣu.</note>
<note n="0587007" resp="#resp2" type="orig" place="foot text" target="#nkr_note_orig_0587007">相應 viyoga.（梵本）</note>
<note n="0587008" resp="#resp2" type="orig" place="foot text" target="#nkr_note_orig_0587008">清涼</note>
<note n="0587009" resp="#resp2" type="orig" place="foot text" target="#nkr_note_orig_0587009">Oṁ ā hūṁ phaṭ svāhā.</note>
</p></cb:div>
<cb:div type="rest-notes"><head>其他校注</head><p>
